<Base title="About" description="Drew Stone: AI infrastructure, automated research, mathematics, and computer science.">
  <h1>About me</h1>
  <p>I'm Drew Stone.
    I work on AI infrastructure at <a href="https://tangle.tools">Tangle</a>.
    Before that, I founded the Edgeware blockchain and built a bridge for private cryptocurrency payments.</p>
  <p>I want agents to do work that produces something durable: a proof someone else can check, a counterexample that changes a conjecture, or an experiment with enough evidence to reproduce it.</p>
  <p>My interests span mathematics, theoretical computer science, machine learning, quantum information, and physical science.
    I also work on the engineering underneath: execution, evaluation, memory, and coordination between agents.</p>
  <p>The <a href="/research">research pages</a> collect concrete results.
    Each separates the mathematical claim from the record of how it was investigated.
    Corrections remain visible, and missing evidence stays missing.</p>
  <p>The <a href="/posts">essays</a> are broader: things I'm building, questions I'm trying to understand, and ideas I want to test.
    Many are written with AI assistance.
    The <a href="/experiment">authorship record</a> documents that involvement; human originals retain their separate history.</p>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/drewstone">GitHub</a> · <a href="mailto:drewstone329@gmail.com">Email</a></p>
